Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ninth Episode\NThe Broken Idols
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire gave me an\Nappointment in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.62,0:02:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the place he was\Ntalking about! Right below me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.82,0:02:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That construction looks\Nlike a gallows. Strange...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.14,0:02:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is a gallows doing\Nin this castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.10,0:02:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And all those people\Nlined up down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What does all this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Has Prince Sapphire\Nnot arrived yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.30,0:02:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, I'm not putting it on!\N- But you have to put it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.94,0:02:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for the ceremony! It's the\Ncostume for the visit to the sacred idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.70,0:03:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Everyone has one!\N- Put it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.74,0:03:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,The sacred idols\Nhave always protected us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- We must thank them!\N- Yes, that's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.42,0:03:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If I wear it, will you give me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...something to eat?\NI've been fasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.62,0:03:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So now you will give me\Nsomething to eat, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.22,0:03:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, immediately! Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.02,0:03:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,And what would this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stale bread.\NWhoever eats it today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.06,0:03:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,will be blessed and happy\Nall year long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.38,0:03:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's tradition that on this day\Nnothing else is eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The same tradition dictates that\Nyou don't take more than a bite of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's time to get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.46,0:03:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, we have brought you\NHis Highness Prince Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.22,0:03:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is the Prince? I don't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!\NThe Prince is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots!\NWe cannot begin
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.66,0:03:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the ceremony in honor of the sacred\Nidols without Prince Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.46,0:04:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- so run and look for him!\N- I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.78,0:04:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- That sounds like my son's voice.\N- Yes, it was Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.62,0:04:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, beloved parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What have you done\Nwith your costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.06,0:04:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.78,0:04:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,How funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.26,0:04:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,With that funny outfit,\Nhe looks like a scarecrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.14,0:04:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, be polite\Nand stop laughing!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.86,0:04:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mom.\NI couldn't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The program\Nof today's ceremony...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...includes entering the tower\Nin which are kept...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...the images\Nof the ancestors of the idols,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.86,0:04:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,to pay them homage\Nand clean them of dust!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we will enter this\Nsacred place only one at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.82,0:05:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go in first!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.02,0:05:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens, how high it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You will climb to the very top, to the place\Nassigned to each of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,and you will set yourselves\Npatiently to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.58,0:06:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is this? From its appearance\Nit looks like it's a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What a funny face it has!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.18,0:06:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it!\NGet away from there immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.66,0:06:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It is sacrilege\Nto touch the sacred idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.94,0:06:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,it is sacrilege to mock\Nthe images! Sacrilege!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, tell them\Nto open the windows!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Women, now open the\Nwindows and start cleaning! Clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.82,0:06:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is this, father?\N- It is the sovereign idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The idol that was\Nerected by our ancestors...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.22,0:06:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,...to keep evil spirits\Naway from our land!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.18,0:06:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's imposing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid, don't look down\Nor the height will scare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.18,0:06:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she has vertigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,An idol is falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The idol will break!\NThe curse will fall upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! It must have been smashed to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.02,0:07:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank heaven, you are safe! And you\Nmanaged to save the idol too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what punishment is received by\Nsomeone who risks breaking an idol?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... Our law says\Nthat whoever drops an idol...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,..or causes its face to be broken\Nwill have their face cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If they cause an arm or a\Nleg to be broken, they will have theirs cut off too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.02,0:07:53.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And finally... if they cause the head to be broken,\Nthey will be hanged!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Well said! Even the daughters\Nof noblemen, like you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.94,0:07:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,can be punished!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.86,0:08:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so harsh!\NAfter all, the idol didn't break!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to thank you\Nfor saving the idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I will put it back in its place.\NGive it here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:07.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.90,0:08:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness...!\NAll's well that ends well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.58,0:08:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You take care of them, Nylon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.74,0:08:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, Sire.\N- Who is coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.34,0:08:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.10,0:08:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really curious to see\Nwhat's in that strange building.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.82,0:08:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to scare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.30,0:08:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Good heavens! The idol is falling!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.62,0:08:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it?! Come on, say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't faint over so little, ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.14,0:09:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.06,0:09:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It was all my fault,\NBaron Nylon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, bring him here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.50,0:09:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Right away, Grand Duke!\N- No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Let me go! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Majesty, your seal will\Nbe enough on this Order...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.62,0:09:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...and we will proceed\Nimmediately to the execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.14,0:09:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My heart breaks\Nto execute a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,but even if it's hard,\Nthe law is the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who is this hothead?\N- But it's His Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want to do with Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that young rascal\Nwho is to be executed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.70,0:09:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Executed?! - Unfortunately, he has\Ncommitted a major crime,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.86,0:10:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,by breaking one of our idols.\NNow he must pay with his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.98,0:10:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But that is terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.22,0:10:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.22,0:10:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Your Highness? Have you gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.66,0:10:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.62,0:10:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I must put an end to this\Nsuperstition or others will die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.54,0:11:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There, now I feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.22,0:11:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Have they broken other idols?\NWhat a sacrilegious act!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.86,0:11:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Therefore, Sire,\Nyou must sign...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...for the immediate execution\Nof the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You sign for me.\NI am sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.02,0:11:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.74,0:11:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for my bed to be prepared
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,At your command, Majesty
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.14,0:11:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Duralumin!\N- Yes, Sire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.14,0:11:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say if we passed a\Nlaw to abolish the death penalty?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.94,0:11:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not a good idea, Your Majesty.\NHave you considered...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...that if we do not punish those\Nwho break the sacred idols,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.70,0:11:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the evil spirits\Nwill curse us...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.06,0:11:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...and fill your kingdom\Nwith misfortune and death?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness! I don't want\Nsuch a thing to happen!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's better! Begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.42,0:12:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be hanged from the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.42,0:12:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But that is my son Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.46,0:12:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, dear parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.10,0:12:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Duralumin!\NWhat the devil have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.30,0:12:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why should my daughter... I\Nmean, my son be executed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.02,0:12:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the death\Nwarrant with your seal!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,His Highness has broken 30 idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.38,0:12:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my Sapphire! What have you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.94,0:12:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Why did you\Nwant to break our laws...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.74,0:12:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...and commit such a sacrilege?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, mother! I\Ndidn't want to make you cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! If only I\Ncould untie myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, we will soon begin\Nthe execution of the verdict.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Such a good boy!\N- Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.86,0:13:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire, no! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.74,0:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!\NThe law forbids you to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.14,0:13:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Nylon, let me pass,\Nplease!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.38,0:14:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You cannot go up the tower!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.90,0:14:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Your Highness, I am\Nforced to do my duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.38,0:14:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you really want to hang him, dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.22,0:14:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I feel very sorry for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.74,0:14:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Watch, instead,\Nand learn how it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, are you glad\Nthat we will go to Heaven together?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.66,0:14:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, my son!\NPass me the rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, Prince, escape!\N- Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.22,0:14:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire has freed himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.22,0:14:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, Prince Sapphire\Nhas rebelled!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.34,0:14:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Damn it!\N- Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.46,0:14:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Our son Sapphire!\N- It's true, our son...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.90,0:14:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- He will not escape his punishment!\N- But I...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.30,0:14:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Sapphire, now,\Nis an outlaw,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so shoot arrows at him\Nand kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.70,0:14:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Duralumin! Not this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think? That the life\Nof the Prince is more important...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.58,0:14:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...or the existence of Silverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.14,0:15:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.50,0:15:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late!\NI can't make it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, it is useless for you\Nto rebel against your destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.38,0:15:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your parents will not be left\Nwith a good memory of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,..if you perish as a rebel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see me\Ndead, Baron Nylon, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.22,0:15:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't let you win,\Nthis time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.14,0:15:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Let's help Prince Sapphire!\N- Let's help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.90,0:15:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that scoundrel who dares\Nto destroy the last sacred idols?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.22,0:15:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Courage! Courage, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.90,0:15:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, my dear parents..!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.86,0:15:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go help Sapphire!\NLet's do as he does!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:15:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We absolutely must do\Nsomething! Let's help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.94,0:16:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's help Sapphire!\NWe must help him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.94,0:16:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening? Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A crowd of women is\Nrushing at the sacred idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.30,0:16:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,They say they want\Nto help the Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.54,0:16:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot allow\Nsuch a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home, wife,\Nor I'll lose my job!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think just because you earn a few measly coins, you can order me around?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.46,0:16:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But dear...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.26,0:16:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job! You did well!\NLet's break everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.30,0:16:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Women, please, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.34,0:16:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me! That'll\Nteach you to touch a lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned breed of savages!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop the execution and\Narrest these frantic women!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.02,0:17:06.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The women have proven\Nto be smarter than the men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.06,0:17:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How can stones\Ndrive away evil spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we are imprisoned,\Nwe don't care at all..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.14,0:17:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,..about foolish traditions!\NWe will regain our freedom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that we are already\Ncondemned, we all remain happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the fallen\Nidols superstition will fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.74,0:17:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,A lesson must be taught here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.78,0:17:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One of them will go to the gallows!\NWhat do you say? Am I doing the right thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.34,0:17:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.46,0:17:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hail, Mephisto!\N- Duralumin!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.78,0:17:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You tried to kill Sapphire\Nwithout my permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.22,0:17:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will only forgive you if you get me\Nher heart! Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.18,0:18:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Mephisto!\NAll right, I will give it to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.34,0:18:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I cannot get close to Sapphire
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.38,0:18:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,because she always has that angel\Nin the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.30,0:18:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure he is left alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.14,0:18:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, as you wish!\NI will only let him out of the cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.74,0:18:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well? What's new now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.26,0:18:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Follow me, Your Highness.\NThe King wishes to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- All right, take me to him.\N- What do you think he wants to tell you, Sapphire?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.94,0:18:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be a good sign:\Nmaybe he will grant me a pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But then it's a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This time you won't succeed\Nin escaping, Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You will end up being hanged,\Nso resign yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,..and put down that sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Then come and get it,\Nif you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get him and try\Nto make up for it, after that fiasco of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!\NI'm sorry, Prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.90,0:19:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,but I must complete my\Nwork, so let yourself be captured!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.86,0:19:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to?\NThen it will be worse for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What... What a strange wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's lifting me up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.02,0:20:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I did it! This must be\Nthe devil's work!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of cloud is this?!\NI get it, it's Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.02,0:20:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the time has come\Nto step out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.66,0:20:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,All too easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.02,0:20:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It is useless for you to\Ntry to escape your destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.74,0:20:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away\Nwith it, Prince Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.50,0:20:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally I will be able to\Ntear out your male heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.58,0:20:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't dare fight\NMephisto! You wouldn't make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.14,0:20:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto is hurling\Nthe stone idols at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I surrender, Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.58,0:21:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I see with pleasure that you\Nhave come to wiser counsel!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I take one heart from\Nyou, you will still have the other!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.02,0:21:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, the chain is stiff!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.02,0:21:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.14,0:21:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's over for you!\NYou cannot make me succumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.06,0:21:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop fighting me!\N- Never!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.74,0:21:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Even if you're right...\N- Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...stare at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Go back to hell\Nand don't make me angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.70,0:21:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise I will make you suffer\Nthe most excruciating pain...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.30,0:21:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you have ever felt!\NUnderstood?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right,\Nbut don't get any closer than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.02,0:21:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost right now or I'll jump on you\Nand make you feel my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.62,0:22:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm leaving!\NBut stay where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.06,0:22:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel my body weakening!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.10,0:22:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.90,0:22:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're safe!\NBut why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.02,0:22:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry\Nfor causing you so much pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.42,0:22:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, I won't cause you any more!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm glad\NI destroyed the idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.58,0:22:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is he here to do?\N- What does he want?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.78,0:22:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Well! You've had enough fun,\Nhaven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.66,0:22:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you see, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.70,0:22:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have realized that Mephisto\Nis the only evil spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:23:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,So you must be convinced that\Nthose idols were completely useless!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.02,0:23:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it funny to have believed for\Nso long in the power of those stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.26,0:23:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,And you must also have seen that the\Ndevil cannot be defeated with stones!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.86,0:23:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't this make you laugh, Grand Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.06,0:23:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could sink into\Nthe ground! Like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.02,0:23:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It takes very little to\Ndefeat superstitions!
